---
title: "a pod's life"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  pending: pending
  state "running" as running {
    init: init containers run
    ready: ready
    notready: not ready
    [*] --> init
    init --> ready: all containers up
    ready --> notready: a readiness probe fails
    notready --> ready: the probe passes again
  }
  succeeded: succeeded
  failed: failed
  [*] --> pending
  pending --> running: scheduled and images pulled
  pending --> failed: image pull backs off for good
  running --> succeeded: every container exits 0
  running --> failed: a container exits non-zero [unless restart policy is Always]
  succeeded --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
